      "x": 1258,
      "y": 832,
      "width": 329,
      "height": 167,
      "text": "Workbench (v0.2+)   browser surface\n\nFastAPI backend (workbench/app.py)\n  /api/health  /api/version  /api/assets\n  /api/runs (with SSE log stream)\n  /api/query (POST: ctx.sql + DuckDB)\n  /api/chat (POST: AI Copilot)\n\nReact + Vite + Tailwind frontend\n  asset graph view, catalog, query editor, chat",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Workbench (v0.2+)   browser surface\n\nFastAPI backend (workbench/app.py)\n  /api/health  /api/version  /api/assets\n  /api/runs (with SSE log stream)\n  /api/query (POST: ctx.sql + DuckDB)\n  /api/chat (POST: AI Copilot)\n\nReact + Vite + Tailwind frontend\n  asset graph view, catalog, query editor, chat",
