      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ERROR DISPLAY  (uniform across all 3 surfaces)\n  per docs/specs/nucleus_cli_spec.md Section 5.4\n\n[NE2007] NucleusResourceError:\n  Out of memory while processing 'sales.fct_orders'\n  fix_hint: add a partition filter, increase memory,\n            or use compute=databricks\n  docs:    nucleus.dev/errors/resource\n\nSame NE-code. Same user_message. Same fix_hint.\nNo DuckDB / Dagster / pyiceberg classnames - ever.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
